Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '$.hours', ''), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE key = 'contact';
UPDATE settings SET value = json_set(value, '$.instagram', 'https://www.instagram.com/jopearlhomemakersintl/'), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE key = 'social';
UPDATE settings SET value = json_set(value, '$.about', 'Project design and execution for residential and commercial spaces, from carcass to finishing and furnishing. Established 2006 · RC 958458 · A member of Jopearl Int''l Ltd.'), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE key = 'footer';
UPDATE settings SET value = json_set(value, '$.title', 'Jo-pearl Homemakers | Interior Design, Finishing & Furnishing in Lagos', '$.description', 'Since 2006, Jo-pearl Homemakers International has delivered over 3,000 residential and commercial projects: design and rendering, space planning, interior and exterior finishing, furnishing and facility management. Lekki, Lagos.'), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE key = 'seo';
